OL,3,GNEWSAFootage captures moment rapist who
OL,4,Aabused pregnant partner is arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage released by police has captured
OL,7,Fthe moments a rapist who abused his
OL,8,Fex-partner during her pregnancy and
OL,9,Fpost-partum period was arrested.
OL,11,FElliot Bulman, 22, was jailed for 15
OL,12,Fyears after subjecting his former
OL,13,Fpartner Nicole to sexual, physical,
OL,14,Femotional, psychological and financial
OL,15,Fabuse - in a "calculated campaign of
OL,16,Fisolation".
OL,18,FBulman, from Manchester, was arrested
OL,19,Fafter attacking Nicole in public -
OL,20,Fprompting her to flee and come forward
OL,21,Fto police.
